    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but being a \"vessel\" for thoughts doesn't change the fact that none of them lead anywhere. i feel like i've spent my whole life building a monument to a ghost. if there's no objective meaning, then all this effort, all this struggle... it's just a cruel joke, isn't it? it feels like there's no reason to keep trying to fill the vessel if the vessel itself doesn't matter.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
